#N canvas 120 60 1300 760 12;
#X text 20 10 fs_sphere <name> <n1> ... <n9> - the alignment sphere for a sensor-fusion sensor whose Pi pipeline runs Orientation + Alignment (dome9: 8 notes in a ring just above the horizon \, counterclockwise from front \, then 1 overhead). Point at a note to bring it in \; point dead-on and move to recruit its overtones. MOTION GATE: notes only sound while you move (rotation 20..250 deg/s or gravity-free acceleration 0.1..1 g \, whichever is larger) and fade within ~2 s of stopping (time constant 0.5 s) - so holding still \, e.g. at the start pose \, is silent. Settings inlet: release <ms> | release_n <i> <ms> | attack <ms> | attack_n <i> <ms> | note <i> <midi> | gate <0..1> (1 = fully motion-gated \, 0 = pointing alone). Defaults: attack 40 ms \, release 600 ms \, gate 1. Notes are numbered 1..9., f 150;
#X obj 20 150 inlet;
#X obj 20 180 route release release_n attack attack_n note gate;
#X obj 200 220 route 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9;
#X obj 450 220 route 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9;
#X obj 700 220 route 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9;
#X obj 950 150 fs_in \$1 corrected_gyro_mag;
#X obj 950 180 fs_map 20 250 0 1;
#X obj 1150 150 fs_in \$1 linear_acc_mag;
#X obj 1150 180 fs_map 0.1 1 0 1;
#X obj 950 220 max;
#X obj 950 250 fs_smooth 60 500;
#X obj 950 290 expr 1 - $f2 + $f2 * $f1;
#X obj 1150 250 loadbang;
#X msg 1150 280 1;
#X obj 950 330 fs_map 30 600 0 1;
#X obj 20 300 fs_in \$1 sphere;
#X obj 20 330 unpack f f f f f f f f f;
#X obj 20 690 outlet~;
#X obj 20 400 fs_smooth 40 600;
#X obj 20 470 *;
#X obj 20 560 fs_partials \$2;
#X obj 155 430 fs_smooth 40 600;
#X obj 155 500 *;
#X obj 155 590 fs_partials \$3;
